#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`sensor` --- camera sensor"
msgstr ":mod:`sensor` --- 相機感測器"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``sensor`` module is deprecated. Use the new :mod:`csi` module (see "
":doc:`omv.csi`) instead. No new features will be added to this module and it"
" may be removed in a future release."
msgstr ""
"``sensor`` 模組已棄用。請改用新的 :mod:`csi` 模組（參見 :doc:`omv.csi`\\ "
"）。本模組不會再新增任何功能，並且可能在未來的版本中移除。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:13
msgid ""
"The :mod:`sensor` module is the legacy module-level interface to the primary"
" camera sensor on an OpenMV Cam. Every call is a free function that operates"
" on a single hidden ``CSI`` instance, which limits support for boards with "
"more than one camera. It is preserved for backwards compatibility with older"
" OpenMV scripts; new code should use the object-oriented :mod:`csi` module "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":mod:`sensor` 模組是 OpenMV Cam 上主相機感測器的舊版模組層級介面。每個呼叫都是對單一隱藏的 ``CSI`` "
"實例進行操作的自由函式，這限制了對具有多個相機的開發板的支援。它被保留以維持與舊版 OpenMV 指令碼的向後相容性；新程式碼應改用物件導向的 "
":mod:`csi` 模組。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:20
msgid ""
"The function names follow the older ``set_pixformat`` / ``set_framesize`` "
"style. Each function corresponds one-to-one to a method on :class:`csi.CSI`;"
" see the :mod:`csi` module for the complete capability set and per-argument "
"descriptions."
msgstr ""
"函式名稱沿用較舊的 ``set_pixformat`` / ``set_framesize`` 風格。每個函式都與 :class:`csi.CSI` "
"上的方法一對一對應；完整的功能集與各參數說明請參見 :mod:`csi` 模組。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:25
msgid "Example usage::"
msgstr "使用範例::"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:38
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "函式"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:42
msgid "Initializes the camera sensor."
msgstr "初始化相機感測器。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:46
msgid ""
"Puts the camera to sleep if ``enable`` is ``True``. Otherwise, wakes it back"
" up."
msgstr "若 ``enable`` 為 ``True`` 則使相機進入睡眠狀態，否則將其喚醒。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:50
msgid ""
"Puts the camera into a lower power mode than sleep. The camera must be reset"
" on being woken up."
msgstr "使相機進入比睡眠更低的省電模式。喚醒時必須重設相機。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:55
msgid "Copies whatever was in the frame buffer to the IDE preview."
msgstr "將影格緩衝區中的任何內容複製到 IDE 預覽。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:59
msgid "Takes a picture using the camera and returns an `image.Image` object."
msgstr "使用相機拍攝一張照片並回傳一個 `image.Image` 物件。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:61
msgid ""
"If `sensor.set_auto_rotation()` is enabled this method returns a new already"
" rotated `image.Image` object."
msgstr "若已啟用 `sensor.set_auto_rotation()`\\ ，此方法會回傳一個已旋轉的全新 `image.Image` 物件。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:66
msgid ""
"Skips ``n`` frames or ``time`` milliseconds (whichever is specified) to let "
"the camera image stabilize after changing camera settings."
msgstr "跳過 ``n`` 個影格或 ``time`` 毫秒（以指定者為準），以便在變更相機設定後讓相機影像穩定下來。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:69
msgid ""
"If neither ``n`` nor ``time`` is specified this method skips frames for 300 "
"milliseconds."
msgstr "若既未指定 ``n`` 也未指定 ``time``\\ ，此方法會跳過影格 300 毫秒。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:72
msgid ""
"If both are specified this method skips ``n`` frames but will timeout after "
"``time`` milliseconds."
msgstr "若兩者皆指定，此方法會跳過 ``n`` 個影格，但會在 ``time`` 毫秒後逾時。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:77
msgid "Returns the sensor resolution width."
msgstr "回傳感測器解析度寬度。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:81
msgid "Returns the sensor resolution height."
msgstr "回傳感測器解析度高度。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:85
msgid ""
"Returns the image object returned by a previous call of `sensor.snapshot()`."
" Returns ``None`` if `sensor.snapshot()` has not been called before."
msgstr ""
"回傳先前呼叫 `sensor.snapshot()` 所回傳的影像物件。若先前未曾呼叫 `sensor.snapshot()`\\ ，則回傳 "
"``None``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:90
msgid "Returns the camera module ID. See the sensor constants below."
msgstr "回傳相機模組 ID。請參見下方的感測器常數。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:94
msgid ""
"Returns ``True`` if a frame is available to read by calling "
"`sensor.snapshot()`."
msgstr "若有可透過呼叫 `sensor.snapshot()` 讀取的影格可用，則回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:100 ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:107
msgid ""
"This function is deprecated and will raise ``OSError``. Use the new "
":mod:`csi` module instead."
msgstr "此函式已棄用，並將引發 ``OSError``\\ 。請改用新的 :mod:`csi` 模組。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:112
msgid "Sets the pixel format for the camera module. ``pixformat`` is one of:"
msgstr "設定相機模組的像素格式。\\ ``pixformat`` 為下列其中之一："

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:114
msgid "`sensor.BINARY`"
msgstr "`sensor.BINARY`"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:115
msgid "`sensor.GRAYSCALE`"
msgstr "`sensor.GRAYSCALE`"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:116
msgid "`sensor.RGB565`"
msgstr "`sensor.RGB565`"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:117
msgid "`sensor.BAYER`"
msgstr "`sensor.BAYER`"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:118
msgid "`sensor.YUV422`"
msgstr "`sensor.YUV422`"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:119
msgid "`sensor.JPEG` (only for the OV2640/OV5640)"
msgstr "`sensor.JPEG`\\ （僅適用於 OV2640/OV5640）"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:123
msgid "Returns the current pixformat for the camera module."
msgstr "回傳相機模組目前的像素格式。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:127
msgid ""
"Sets the frame size for the camera module. See the framesize constants below"
" for valid values."
msgstr "設定相機模組的影格大小。有效值請參見下方的影格大小常數。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:132
msgid "Returns the current frame size for the camera module."
msgstr "回傳相機模組目前的影格大小。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:136
msgid "Sets the frame rate in Hz for the camera module."
msgstr "設定相機模組的影格速率（以 Hz 為單位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:140
msgid "Returns the frame rate in Hz for the camera module."
msgstr "回傳相機模組的影格速率（以 Hz 為單位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:144
msgid ""
"Sets the resolution of the camera to a sub-resolution inside of the current "
"resolution."
msgstr "將相機的解析度設定為目前解析度內的子解析度。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:147
msgid ""
"``roi`` is a rect tuple/list ``(x, y, w, h)``. You may also pass ``(w, h)`` "
"and the ``roi`` will be centered on the frame. The arguments may also be "
"passed unpacked as positional integers."
msgstr ""
"``roi`` 是一個矩形元組／串列 ``(x, y, w, h)``\\ 。您也可以傳入 ``(w, h)``\\ ，則 ``roi`` "
"會以影格為中心。這些引數也可以拆開作為位置整數傳入。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:153
msgid ""
"Returns the ``roi`` tuple ``(x, y, w, h)`` previously set with "
"`sensor.set_windowing()`."
msgstr "回傳先前以 `sensor.set_windowing()` 設定的 ``roi`` 元組 ``(x, y, w, h)``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:158
msgid ""
"Set the camera image gain ceiling. Valid values are ``2``, ``4``, ``8``, "
"``16``, ``32``, ``64``, or ``128``. Returns ``True`` on success."
msgstr ""
"設定相機影像的增益上限。有效值為 ``2``\\ 、\\ ``4``\\ 、\\ ``8``\\ 、\\ ``16``\\ 、\\ ``32``\\ "
"、\\ ``64`` 或 ``128``\\ 。成功時回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:163
msgid ""
"Set the camera image contrast. Valid range is ``-3`` to ``+3``. Returns "
"``True`` on success."
msgstr "設定相機影像對比度。有效範圍為 ``-3`` 至 ``+3``\\ 。成功時回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:168
msgid ""
"Set the camera image brightness. Valid range is ``-3`` to ``+3``. Returns "
"``True`` on success."
msgstr "設定相機影像亮度。有效範圍為 ``-3`` 至 ``+3``\\ 。成功時回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:173
msgid ""
"Set the camera image saturation. Valid range is ``-3`` to ``+3``. Returns "
"``True`` on success."
msgstr "設定相機影像飽和度。有效範圍為 ``-3`` 至 ``+3``\\ 。成功時回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:178
msgid ""
"Set the camera image JPEG compression quality. Valid range is ``0`` to "
"``100``. Returns ``True`` on success. Only for the OV2640/OV5640 cameras."
msgstr ""
"設定相機影像的 JPEG 壓縮品質。有效範圍為 ``0`` 至 ``100``\\ 。成功時回傳 ``True``\\ 。僅適用於 "
"OV2640/OV5640 相機。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:183
msgid ""
"Turns color bar test mode on (``True``) or off (``False``). Returns ``True``"
" on success."
msgstr "開啟（\\ ``True``\\ ）或關閉（\\ ``False``\\ ）色彩條測試模式。成功時回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:188
msgid "``enable`` turns auto gain control on (``1``) or off (``0``)."
msgstr "``enable`` 開啟（\\ ``1``\\ ）或關閉（\\ ``0``\\ ）自動增益控制。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:190
msgid ""
"If ``enable`` is ``0`` you may set a fixed gain in decibels with "
"``gain_db``."
msgstr "若 ``enable`` 為 ``0``\\ ，您可以透過 ``gain_db`` 設定固定的增益（以分貝為單位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:192
msgid ""
"If ``enable`` is non-zero you may set the maximum gain ceiling in decibels "
"with ``gain_db_ceiling`` for the automatic gain control algorithm."
msgstr ""
"若 ``enable`` 為非零值，您可以透過 ``gain_db_ceiling`` 為自動增益控制演算法設定最大增益上限（以分貝為單位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:195
msgid "``gain_db`` and ``gain_db_ceiling`` are keyword-only arguments."
msgstr "``gain_db`` 與 ``gain_db_ceiling`` 為僅限關鍵字引數。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:199
msgid "Returns the current camera gain value in decibels."
msgstr "回傳目前相機增益值（以分貝為單位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:203
msgid "``enable`` turns auto exposure control on (``1``) or off (``0``)."
msgstr "``enable`` 開啟（\\ ``1``\\ ）或關閉（\\ ``0``\\ ）自動曝光控制。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:205
msgid ""
"If ``enable`` is ``0`` you may set a fixed exposure time in microseconds "
"with ``exposure_us``. ``exposure_us`` is a keyword-only argument."
msgstr ""
"若 ``enable`` 為 ``0``\\ ，您可以透過 ``exposure_us`` 設定固定的曝光時間（以微秒為單位）。\\ "
"``exposure_us`` 為僅限關鍵字引數。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:210
msgid "Returns the current camera exposure value in microseconds."
msgstr "回傳目前相機曝光值（以微秒為單位）。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:214
msgid "``enable`` turns auto white balance on (``1``) or off (``0``)."
msgstr "``enable`` 開啟（\\ ``1``\\ ）或關閉（\\ ``0``\\ ）自動白平衡。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:216
msgid ""
"If ``enable`` is ``0`` you may set a fixed gain in decibels for the red, "
"green, and blue channels respectively with ``rgb_gain_db``. ``rgb_gain_db`` "
"is a keyword-only argument."
msgstr ""
"若 ``enable`` 為 ``0``\\ ，您可以透過 ``rgb_gain_db`` 分別為紅、綠、藍通道設定固定的增益（以分貝為單位）。\\ "
"``rgb_gain_db`` 為僅限關鍵字引數。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:222
msgid ""
"Returns a tuple with the current camera red, green, and blue gain values in "
"decibels."
msgstr "回傳一個包含目前相機紅、綠、藍增益值（以分貝為單位）的元組。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:227
msgid "Sets the auto black level calibration (BLC) control on the camera."
msgstr "設定相機上的自動黑階校正（BLC）控制。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:229
msgid "``enable`` is ``1`` to enable or ``0`` to disable."
msgstr "``enable`` 為 ``1`` 表示啟用，\\ ``0`` 表示停用。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:231
msgid ""
"``regs`` if disabled, you can manually set the BLC register values via the "
"values previously read from `sensor.get_blc_regs()`. The list length must "
"match the sensor's BLC register count."
msgstr ""
"``regs`` 若停用時，您可以透過先前從 `sensor.get_blc_regs()` 讀取的值手動設定 BLC 暫存器值。串列長度必須與感測器的"
" BLC 暫存器數量相符。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:237
msgid ""
"Returns the sensor BLC registers as a list of integers. For use with "
"`sensor.set_auto_blc()`."
msgstr "以整數串列回傳感測器 BLC 暫存器。供 `sensor.set_auto_blc()` 使用。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:242
msgid ""
"Turns horizontal mirror mode on (``True``) or off (``False``). Defaults to "
"off."
msgstr "開啟（\\ ``True``\\ ）或關閉（\\ ``False``\\ ）水平鏡像模式。預設為關閉。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:246
msgid "Returns ``True`` if horizontal mirror mode is enabled."
msgstr "若已啟用水平鏡像模式，則回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:250
msgid ""
"Turns vertical flip mode on (``True``) or off (``False``). Defaults to off."
msgstr "開啟（\\ ``True``\\ ）或關閉（\\ ``False``\\ ）垂直翻轉模式。預設為關閉。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:254
msgid "Returns ``True`` if vertical flip mode is enabled."
msgstr "若已啟用垂直翻轉模式，則回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:258
msgid ""
"Turns transpose mode on (``True``) or off (``False``). Defaults to off."
msgstr "開啟（\\ ``True``\\ ）或關閉（\\ ``False``\\ ）轉置模式。預設為關閉。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:260
msgid "vflip=False, hmirror=False, transpose=False -> 0 degree rotation"
msgstr "vflip=False, hmirror=False, transpose=False -> 旋轉 0 度"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:261
msgid "vflip=True,  hmirror=False, transpose=True  -> 90 degree rotation"
msgstr "vflip=True,  hmirror=False, transpose=True  -> 旋轉 90 度"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:262
msgid "vflip=True,  hmirror=True,  transpose=False -> 180 degree rotation"
msgstr "vflip=True,  hmirror=True,  transpose=False -> 旋轉 180 度"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:263
msgid "vflip=False, hmirror=True,  transpose=True  -> 270 degree rotation"
msgstr "vflip=False, hmirror=True,  transpose=True  -> 旋轉 270 度"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:267
msgid "Returns ``True`` if transpose mode is enabled."
msgstr "若已啟用轉置模式，則回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:271
msgid ""
"Turns auto rotation mode on (``True``) or off (``False``). Defaults to off. "
"Only works when the OpenMV Cam has an :py:mod:`imu` installed."
msgstr ""
"開啟（\\ ``True``\\ ）或關閉（\\ ``False``\\ ）自動旋轉模式。預設為關閉。僅當 OpenMV Cam 安裝了 "
":py:mod:`imu` 時才有效。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:276
msgid "Returns ``True`` if auto rotation mode is enabled."
msgstr "若已啟用自動旋轉模式，則回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:280
msgid "Sets the number of frame buffers used to receive image data."
msgstr "設定用於接收影像資料的影格緩衝區數量。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:282
msgid ""
"``count`` may be ``1`` (single buffer), ``2`` (double buffer), ``3`` (triple"
" buffer), or ``4`` or greater to put the sensor driver into video FIFO mode "
"where received frames are stored in a FIFO of ``count`` buffers."
msgstr ""
"``count`` 可以是 ``1``\\ （單緩衝）、\\ ``2``\\ （雙緩衝）、\\ ``3``\\ （三緩衝），或 ``4`` "
"以上以使感測器驅動程式進入視訊 FIFO 模式，此時接收到的影格會儲存在一個由 ``count`` 個緩衝區組成的 FIFO 中。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:288
msgid "Returns the current number of frame buffers allocated."
msgstr "回傳目前已配置的影格緩衝區數量。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:292
msgid ""
"If ``disable`` is ``True`` then disable all settling time delays in the "
"sensor module."
msgstr "若 ``disable`` 為 ``True``\\ ，則停用感測器模組中所有的穩定時間延遲。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:295
msgid "If called with no arguments returns ``True`` if delays are disabled."
msgstr "若不帶引數呼叫，當延遲被停用時回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:299
msgid ""
"If ``disable`` is ``True`` then automatic framebuffer flushing on frame drop"
" is disabled."
msgstr "若 ``disable`` 為 ``True``\\ ，則停用掉格時的自動影格緩衝區清除。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:302
msgid ""
"If called with no arguments returns ``True`` if automatic flushing is "
"disabled."
msgstr "若不帶引數呼叫，當自動清除被停用時回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:307
msgid ""
"Sets the special digital effect (SDE) on the sensor. ``sde`` is one of "
"`sensor.NORMAL` or `sensor.NEGATIVE`. Returns ``True`` on success."
msgstr ""
"設定感測器上的特殊數位效果（SDE）。\\ ``sde`` 為 `sensor.NORMAL` 或 `sensor.NEGATIVE` "
"其中之一。成功時回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:312
msgid ""
"``enable`` ``True`` to enable, ``False`` to disable. ``radi`` integer radius"
" of pixels to correct. ``coef`` power of correction."
msgstr ""
"``enable`` ``True`` 表示啟用，\\ ``False`` 表示停用。\\ ``radi`` 為要校正的像素半徑（整數）。\\ "
"``coef`` 為校正強度。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:316
msgid "Returns ``True`` on success."
msgstr "成功時回傳 ``True``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:320
msgid ""
"Registers callback ``cb`` to be executed (in interrupt context) whenever the"
" camera module generates a new frame (but before the frame is received)."
msgstr "註冊回呼函式 ``cb``\\ ，使其在相機模組產生新影格時（但在接收該影格之前）於中斷情境中執行。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:323
msgid ""
"``cb`` takes one argument: the current state of the vsync pin after "
"changing."
msgstr "``cb`` 接受一個引數：vsync 接腳變更後的目前狀態。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:325 ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:335
msgid "Pass a non-callable (e.g. ``None``) to unregister."
msgstr "傳入不可呼叫的值（例如 ``None``\\ ）以取消註冊。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:329
msgid ""
"Registers callback ``cb`` to be executed (in interrupt context) whenever the"
" camera module generates a new frame and the frame is ready to be read via "
"`sensor.snapshot()`."
msgstr "註冊回呼函式 ``cb``\\ ，使其在相機模組產生新影格且該影格已可透過 `sensor.snapshot()` 讀取時，於中斷情境中執行。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:333
msgid "``cb`` takes no arguments."
msgstr "``cb`` 不接受任何引數。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:339
msgid ""
"Execute a sensor-specific request. ``request`` is one of the :data:`IOCTL_*`"
" constants; the remaining positional arguments and the return value depend "
"on the request. The supported requests are grouped by sensor family below."
msgstr ""
"執行特定於感測器的請求。\\ ``request`` 為 :data:`IOCTL_*` "
"常數之一；其餘的位置引數與回傳值取決於該請求。支援的請求依感測器系列分組於下方。"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:344
msgid "**Generic (any sensor):**"
msgstr "**通用（任何感測器）：**"

#: ../../library/omv.sensor.rst:346
